#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:3
#: b535085801a84973adef456a78f715ac
msgid "有序合金原型（Ordered Alloy Prototype）"
msgstr "Ordered Alloy Prototype"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:5
#: cf15b9b052874532ab2863cadf9f9a09
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard`"
msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:7
#: aa1ec799a542448ea7d0de7a334c3db8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:9
#: 4c000a3081cb4370bebca59b49baed33
msgid ""
"生成带晶体学子晶格身份的周期结构，首批支持 A1/fcc、A2/bcc、A3/hcp、L1₂/A3B、B2/AB 和 L1₀/AB。子晶格写入逐原子数组"
" `atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`；它不会占用 `group`，因此后续仍可独立添加磁序分层、奇偶层或区域标签。"
msgstr ""
"Generate periodic structures with explicit crystallographic sublattice "
"identity. Initial support covers A1/fcc, A2/bcc, A3/hcp, L1₂/A3B, B2/AB, and"
" L1₀/AB. Sublattices are stored in the per-atom array "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]` and do not consume `group`, so magnetic-order"
" layers, alternating layers, or region labels can still be added "
"independently downstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:11
#: e4369deff460448fa42b2d44ebaee7d3
msgid ""
"这张卡只建立晶胞、周期边界、分数坐标和子晶格。元素占位可以先给真实元素，也可以用 `X` 占位符，再交给 `Finite-Cell Alloy "
"Occupancy` 生成整数可实现的有序或部分无序合金。"
msgstr ""
"This card creates only the cell, periodic boundaries, fractional "
"coordinates, and sublattices. Element occupancy may use real elements "
"immediately or the `X` placeholder, then pass to `Finite-Cell Alloy "
"Occupancy` to generate ordered or partially disordered alloys with "
"realizable integer counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:13
#: 2e687f1cae1343a098d1452f9f4159bc
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:15
#: 86508878147f47599eb74c4102fc95b3
msgid "场景：L1₂ 相测试误差高，但训练集中没有保留角点/面心身份"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: high test error for L1₂ phases, but corner/face-center identity "
"was not retained in the training set"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:17
#: 66a7f00f31fd4d85b222804836f70f04
msgid "模型在 A3B 型有序相上的力误差明显高于随机固溶体。原训练集把所有 fcc 位点混成同一个集合，无法系统覆盖 A、B 子晶格分别无序化的局域环境。"
msgstr ""
"The model's force error for A3B ordered phases is much higher than for "
"random solid solutions. The original training set merged all fcc sites into "
"one set, so it could not systematically cover local environments where the A"
" and B sublattices are disordered independently."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:19
#: aa33057705e64cf7ad2ae04e9f3ba0bb
msgid ""
"**输入：** 无需输入结构。 **目标：** 先生成 32 原子的 L1₂ 周期超胞，其中 A、B 子晶格严格为 24:8。 **参数设置：** "
"`prototype=\"L12/A3B\"`，`a_range=[3.6,3.6,0.1]`，`sublattice_elements=\"A:X,B:X\"`，手动"
" `rep=[2,2,2]`，`max_atoms=32`。 **输出：** 一个 32 原子周期结构，`sublattice` 中有 24 个 `A`"
" 和 8 个 `B`。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 下游分别约束 A/B 占位并完成 DFT "
"标注后，按原型和子晶格无序程度切片比较能量/力误差；不能只看混合后的总 RMSE。"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** none. **Goal:** first generate a periodic 32-atom L1₂ supercell "
"with a strict A:B sublattice ratio of 24:8. **Parameters:** "
"`prototype=\"L12/A3B\"`, `a_range=[3.6,3.6,0.1]`, "
"`sublattice_elements=\"A:X,B:X\"`, manual `rep=[2,2,2]`, and `max_atoms=32`."
" **Output:** one periodic 32-atom structure whose `sublattice` array "
"contains 24 `A` and 8 `B` entries. **How to verify improved training-set "
"quality:** after constraining A/B occupancies downstream and obtaining DFT "
"labels, compare energy and force errors in slices by prototype and "
"sublattice disorder. Do not rely only on the aggregate RMSE."

