#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:40
#: e1171a2ec3b64f31a1d3ee2dae768a64
msgid "Lattice Range（a_range）"
msgstr "Lattice Range（a_range）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:42
#: 56885334f93048c4889c887db2855198
msgid "`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `[3.6, 3.6, 0.1]`，依次是晶格常数 `a` 的起点、终点和步长，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `[3.6, 3.6, 0.1]`; the start, stop, "
"and step of lattice constant `a`, in Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:44
#: a10efba2bb664b0ab21a499e9f5a0b41
msgid "需要补体积响应时可扫描一段窄范围；只要一个结构时令起点等于终点。每个扫描点都受 `max_outputs` 限制。"
msgstr ""
"Scan a narrow range when volume response is needed. Set start equal to stop "
"when only one structure is required. Every scan point is subject to "
"`max_outputs`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:46
#: 12afb19373644d828be261a09a099d54
msgid "c/a（covera）"
msgstr "c/a（covera）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:48
#: 3595aefc196c46a5bef3775add098101
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.0。A3/hcp 和 L1₀ 使用该值设置 `c/a`；立方 A1、A2、L1₂、B2 固定使用 "
"1，并在界面中禁用该输入，避免误以为它会生效。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 1.0. A3/hcp and L1₀ use this value for `c/a`; cubic A1, A2,"
" L1₂, and B2 fix it at 1 and disable the input in the UI so it cannot appear"
" effective when it is not."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:50
#: 44f8ccde99f04d4a988ad89d05baa12d
msgid "A3 常从理想密排值约 1.633 起步；L1₀ 则应使用目标体系的四方畸变范围。不要用这个参数替代后续的系统应变扫描。"
msgstr ""
"For A3, the ideal close-packed value of about 1.633 is a common starting "
"point. For L1₀, use a tetragonal distortion range appropriate to the target "
"system. Do not use this parameter as a substitute for a systematic "
"downstream strain scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:52
#: 1b97bcdb5a404d7c9daeb681862111b2
msgid "Sublattice Elements（sublattice_elements）"
msgstr "Sublattice Elements（sublattice_elements）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:54
#: e2d4dd7860bc42618dda1335114bc4ed
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"A:X,B:X\"`。按 `标签:元素` 指定基胞占位，例如 `A:Fe,B:Al`；`X` 表示尚未决定元素的占位符。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"A:X,B:X\"`. Assign basis occupancy as `label:element`, for"
" example `A:Fe,B:Al`; `X` means the element has not yet been chosen."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:56
#: 9aab0d7749d34b66a454704981d2416e
msgid ""
"元素选择不带材料先验：卡片不会假设过渡金属属于 A，也不会限制主族元素只能进入 B。切换原型时，界面明确提示所需标签和基胞计数；单子晶格原型只显示 "
"A，不再保留一个当前不会使用的 B 配置。未知标签会明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Element selection carries no material prior: the card does not assume "
"transition metals belong on A or restrict main-group elements to B. When the"
" prototype changes, the UI reports the required labels and basis counts. A "
"single-sublattice prototype shows only A instead of retaining an unused B "
"configuration. Unknown labels fail explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:58
#: 957dda0134264420a7928eaeb33e13a5
msgid "Auto Supercell（auto_supercell）"
msgstr "Auto Supercell（auto_supercell）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:60
#: 8bf4b5d282ca4dd5bba0128eddfed587
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。开启后，在不超过 `max_atoms` 的前提下自动选择三轴重复数。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, the card automatically chooses three-"
"axis repeat counts without exceeding `max_atoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:62
#: 1d7d37be362a404c9a04857f85804403
msgid "自动模式适合快速得到接近预算的周期胞；需要固定 24:8、8:8 等可审计计数时，手动重复通常更直观。"
msgstr ""
"Automatic mode is useful for quickly approaching the atom budget. For "
"auditable fixed counts such as 24:8 or 8:8, manual repeats are usually "
"clearer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:64
#: 35aa68ef4dfa41e4b04c248296a9ecdc
msgid "Max Atoms（max_atoms）"
msgstr "Max Atoms（max_atoms）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:66
#: 4347a6a116494b76b8e27bec6ebca31c
msgid "`int`，默认 128。每个输出结构允许的原子数硬上限。"
msgstr "`int`, default 128. Hard upper bound on atoms in each output structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:68
#: 75e6841f736b4e70b7ec0d0d392f7920
msgid "如果基胞本身或手动 `rep` 超过这个上限，operation 直接抛出 `ValueError`，不会偷偷缩小重复数或返回超预算结构。"
msgstr ""
"If the basis itself or manual `rep` exceeds this bound, the operation raises"
" `ValueError` instead of silently reducing repeat counts or returning an "
"over-budget structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:70
#: c30a015663ca4decb6996ce1eb5a8cea
msgid "Rep（rep）"
msgstr "Rep（rep）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:72
#: fa88dbe2f5d24c4c8988078985c678f7
msgid "`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `[2, 2, 2]`。手动模式下沿三个晶格矢量的重复数。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `[2, 2, 2]`. Manual repeat counts along the "
"three lattice vectors."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:74
#: f70e16c6228e44a2b25c3b9cbb75718c
msgid "生效条件：`auto_supercell=false`。L1₂ 的 `[2,2,2]` 正好得到 32 原子，其中 A:B=24:8。"
msgstr ""
"Applies when `auto_supercell=false`. For L1₂, `[2,2,2]` produces exactly 32 "
"atoms with A:B=24:8."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:76
#: 80d47f54d2124fb59ffc4cc6149dd97f
msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:78
#: b29e4496fd234013b02360d3a32a1672
msgid "`int`，默认 200。晶格常数扫描最多返回的结构数。"
msgstr "`int`, default 200. Maximum structures returned by the lattice-constant scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:80
#: 4a2fdebe791c4769bc5cfb24b7e195e8
msgid "扫描范围很密时，它是独立于原子数的第二道预算门；达到上限后按 `a_range` 的确定顺序停止。"
msgstr ""
"For a dense scan, this is a second budget gate independent of atom count. "
"Once reached, the scan stops in deterministic `a_range` order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:82
#: 92a4b689960e43759301ab82b9cbf33b
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

