#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:120
#: 5ce4353592a6443b89a641bdddc2e3a5
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:122
#: 327c3a457f8945ddb325569befad62cc
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy "
"Occupancy`：先锁定晶体学子晶格，再按每个子晶格的整数计数生成占位。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: first fix "
"crystallographic sublattices, then generate occupancy from integer counts on"
" each sublattice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:123
#: a70d3322236f40899f28d08213142a77
msgid "`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`：补有序相的应变和局域振动环境。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`: add strain and "
"local vibrational environments to the ordered phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:124
#: f034ff4c79aa488aa5014e0c0068a324
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Magnetic Order`：晶体学 `sublattice` 与磁性 `group` "
"分开保存，再独立构造磁序。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Magnetic Order`: keep crystallographic "
"`sublattice` separate from magnetic `group`, then construct magnetic order "
"independently."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:126
#: 51fd33adb84c4849b38c80232451aa11
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:128
#: 4c77898c90994074a80d577c74cf8c9f
msgid "**提示未知子晶格标签。** 首批原型只使用 A/B；占位映射可同时保留 A、B 方便切换原型，但不能写任意新标签。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports an unknown sublattice label.** Initial prototypes use "
"only A/B. The occupancy mapping may retain both A and B to support prototype"
" switching, but it cannot introduce arbitrary new labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:130
#: 635e8f32b2fc4487b45b3a711cbababa
msgid "**手动超胞超过 `max_atoms`。** 卡片会明确失败，不会改变用户给出的重复数。调小 `rep` 或提高原子数预算。"
msgstr ""
"**The manual supercell exceeds `max_atoms`.** The card fails explicitly and "
"does not change the requested repeat counts. Reduce `rep` or raise the atom "
"budget."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:132
#: 76c7ef9f5a4d4c37afd2ae2de2778ddd
msgid "**为什么没有弛豫。** 本卡只生成几何原型。弛豫、势函数调用、LAMMPS、chemical MC 和 DFT 提交不属于该卡职责。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is there no relaxation?** This card only generates a geometric "
"prototype. Relaxation, potential evaluation, LAMMPS, chemical MC, and DFT "
"submission are outside its scope."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:134
#: c621ef993b0440589dc4c828d605e9d5
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:136
#: e45d3fb246e44f8bacaf0a7a1cf7a6f8
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 "
"`OrderedProto(<prototype>,a=<a>,rep=<na>x<nb>x<nc>)`。`ordered_alloy_prototype`"
" metadata 记录原型、晶格参数、重复数、子晶格元素和实际子晶格计数。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` appends `OrderedProto(<prototype>,a=<a>,rep=<na>x<nb>x<nc>)`. "
"The `ordered_alloy_prototype` metadata records the prototype, lattice "
"parameters, repeat counts, sublattice elements, and realized sublattice "
"counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:138
#: c30578ef74384550beac73cd6f273887
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:140
#: 5b80daf7bdbc4acd93496c42bf290c03
msgid "本卡没有随机采样。同一组参数总是得到相同的 cell、PBC、分数坐标、元素和 `sublattice` 数组。"
msgstr ""
"This card performs no random sampling. The same parameters always produce "
"identical cell, PBC, fractional coordinates, elements, and `sublattice` "
"array."
